<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="imt1">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Habakuk chekhai, now arui khin dow 605 BC khe chekhai. Risi Habakuk dow Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang khe kowh Thurai risi chekhai. Aia kowh laiklow dow maru-uüa tut-e krawi tek laiklow mih lak-e Thurai kowi lüntaah mih laiklow lang hu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Habakuk bowih kowi kowh laiklow dow lainowmma klangiung chekhai. Amülüngma hown mami bowih kowi kowh laiklow klangiung mih uang tatüng mih dow sum lawng kowi kowh laiklow kowi chekhai. Nami lawng dow Meng Lai bowih kowi kowh meng iawng Thurai chup kim kowi takua talawm khe natawngah kownkow alai kowh Jihudiuüa mih meng tek miuüa rut kowi ap pe reng chekhai (3:19).</para>
  <para style="ip">Risi Habakuk kowh laiklow dow akeng mih risiuüa kowh laiklow iawng nadowi kowi alangma chekhai. Risi Habakuk kowh dow Thurai tut-e chawk lai mih laiklow lang hu chekhai. Aia dow, “Tawngplawng maru ngakuüa kowi ripah dowi rengreng? Tawngplawng kowchow maru iunguüa lak-e maru ngakuüa lang kür khai? Tawngplawng kowchow chimsaima mih Thurai aia maru-uüa kowi naripah kownkow aia maru-uüa lak-e lang nga mih Babulawnuüa kowi tuk tawngah khai,” pahai Thurai kowi lüntaah khai. Nahanow aia kowi dow Thurai mih klangah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Tawngplawng kowchow Juda kowi ripah dowi pahai Thurai kowi Habakuk lüntaah mih 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda kowi naripla kownkow Babulawnuüa kowi natawngah kown pahai Habakuk kowi Thurai klangah mih 1:5-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda kowi naripla kownkow amatni lak-e nga mih chenchap kowi tawngplawng kowchow tawngah mih Thurai kowi Habakuk lüntaah mih 1:12-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda kowi kowh achinawmma mih maru-uüa naplai kown; tawkche tachi tanawm dowi mih Babulawnuüa dow napiak kown pahai Habakuk kowi Thurai klangah mih 2:1-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Habakuk chup Thurai mih 3:1-19</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Mami dow risi Habakuk tut-e mukmang kowi Thurai uang tek pe mih laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuk chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Habakuk tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:2">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün khowt tak chow ang nalü khowng kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:2">Mün khowt tak chow klang ang dowi kowi en nauowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:2">Nowng chang powng chang rakowi mün khowt tak chow en tut-e ang nauang kar kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:2">Lawng anging dowi kowi mün khowt tak chow en nauowi kown?<verse eid="HAB 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow en pe khi ang angak khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:3">Tawngplawng kowchow nowng changra en kham rengreng tak?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:3">Ang pur kowi piakra hai nowng changra kangowh towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:3">ang pur kowi taranra hai takhüm tabawp kangowh towbowt.<verse eid="HAB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Pren kowi kowh ari aiang miapaw chün dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:4">tara nowm pami hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:4">Maru iunguüa lak-e maru ngakuüa kür lang uowi khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:4">naiawng rakowi tara nowm phaw dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuk kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />CHAKRAMANG klang ang mih, “Akeng chenchapuüa kowi mü büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:5">nahanow lainowmma enni naawda kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni chowng kowi ang nachang pachap kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:5">Nami dow ang tek enni chepaw enni naowm kown nadowi.<verse eid="HAB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Sünta, Babulawn prenchakuüa kowi ang kamrütah thüm khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:6">amatni dow angakma hai bawrima mih chenchap chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:6">now akeng pren krawi powng kownkow palusama kowi krawi kowi büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Amatni kowi dow maru khi-ah now lainowmma maru kramah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:7">amatni dow amatni kowh ari aiang ün amatni thawpah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:7">now amatni dow mia low kowi paw uowi kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Amatni kowh kawrnga hawmh dow pri rengchow lak-e iowm lang len khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:8">amatni dow iak pra kowh sui rang mih lak-e kramra lang uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:8">Amatni kowh kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa dow alakma hownia alenma uang iowm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:8">krawi piak maru kownkow amatni dow uamu iawng alenma uang reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Amatni dow nakrawi chang nowng kownkow uang krawi uang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:9">amatni dow lowra iawng chepaw nataing dowi kown mih tatuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:9">now sema iawng maru iun akawmma kowi khümla reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Amatni dow manguüa kowi prawng renah büa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:10">now kruitown miuüa kowi paw khareah büa reng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:10">Amatni dow kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma mih ün khi hanow ren lawt khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:10">amatni dow napünla tap kownkow plu bawn büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:10">now kangchawngra kimkrowng ün krawi powngta büah khai.<verse eid="HAB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow li iawng linlanma powt reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:11">naiawngün maru-uüa dow angakma mih maru-uüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh kürra dow amatni nüla thurai büah khai rakowi sum büah khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuk plan chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Habakuk plan tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:12">en dow ang kowh chimsaima mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:12">en dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi mih Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:12">Naiawng rakowi asaima pat anging napiak kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:12">Aw CHAKRAMANG, narip anging kownkow Babulawnuüa kowi en tawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:12">aw tatung tanimra hungh, nahawi anging kownkow Babulawnuüa kowi en tawngah khai.<verse eid="HAB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />En dow chinawmma rakowi angak kowi nowng mü dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:13">chang ngak mih kowi dow en ripah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:13">Naiawng e tawngplawng kowchow kuanlama miuüa kowi aiungma en müah rereng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:13">Tawngplawng kowchow maru iunguüa kowi maru ngakuüa krawi piakah khe ririmma en uowi rereng?<verse eid="HAB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow en maru-uüa kowi sata kowi kowh dam iawng en changah khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:14">Tawngplawng kowchow kam mih hai sowr mih chap kowh kruitown mih uowi dowi iawng en tuk towah khai?<verse eid="HAB 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Babulawnuüa dow kuak kuai khe kowh iawng maru-uüa kowi küngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:15">now pat lawk khe kowh iawng amatni kowi dow arasang uang kuala khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:15">Naiawng krawi chang mih hownia Babulawnuüa dow piaw hai awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh lawk vüi tawncher hown chang phuchua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:16">now krawi khuila maru reng mih lawk vüi nam iungma mih maikhük towk pe büah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 1:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow naiawngün lawk hown marat reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:16">now chak iung kham iung paw ka cha ka kham büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Chowngchowng saksakma naiawng amatni kowi en natowah rengreng kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 1:17">saksing sana dowi kowi chenchapuüa kowi amatni kowi en pe krawi piakah reng kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Ang dow kangchawngra kimkrowng kowi nahawt iowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:1">tawng chow CHAKRAMANG natek ang kown mih ang nahawt sünta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:1">now ang awr chawk lai mih kowi tawng iawng chow aia nauang klang ang kown mih ang nahawt chawng kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuk kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:2">“Mukmang kowi kowh mami laiklow ruiah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:2">mami dow aiachow naia phatla kownkow huapher kowi klangiungma ruiah diah.<verse eid="HAB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mukmang kowi kowh mami laiklow natachi kown mih akhin uowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">mami dow alenma nauang tachi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">mami mukmang dow dai lai nadowi chekhai pami nakhi-ah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:3">Mukmang laiklow nauang tachi kown mih kra tak chepaw hawt chawngah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">mami mukmang laiklow dow akhin uang ting now nauang tachi ngengche kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />“Bawrima miuüa dow amatni matia luk kowi owmsak rakowi chownglawng kowi nga reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:4">tawkche achinawmma miuüa dow Thurai luk kowi owm rakowi nasing kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Dawngthawnguan kowi owmsak mih maru dow aiamat takuan mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">lawphara dow makownguüa uowi rah iawng adu uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:5">Naiawng rakowi aia dow akeng chenchapuüa hown krawi tasen reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">now aia dow chenchap maten kowi khümla now pawla khai.<verse eid="HAB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />“Tawkche aia kowi dow maru naprawng renah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">maru natek pe kown mih, ‘Aia luk kowi ripra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:6">Aia dow kür hown krawi pawah mih uanh hown kureng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">tawkche aia napiak kown mih kra dowi bowt,’ napa kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Pakat dow en tut-e kowh kakra uowi miuüa paw narü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">amatni dow rü hanow chür prang nachang en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:7">Nakhowk khe dow amatni tut-e cham rupah mih uanh iawng en nachowng kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />En dow chenchap ahuma kowh dawngthawnguan krawi khün khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">naiawngün chenchap kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa mih en kowh dawngthawnguan nakhünta en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow krawi sai maru reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">en dow pren towng hai marow towng kowi kowh maru maten kowi krawi chang nowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />“En dow angak hown kowh kaah mih tangka hown kim aiukma en thawp khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:9">En kowh dawngthawnguan naia pe en thaulangra kown mih en owm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">naiawngün uowi rah en thawp mih dow phih hownia nakala thaulangra kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Chenchap akawmma kowi en krawi saiah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:10">naiawng rakowi en kimchakuüa dow ka rukrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:10">Naiawng hai en dow en kowh singra mih en mata khai.<verse eid="HAB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />En changla kim mih hua ün natang en aprek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:11">now kim kowi kowh klowng ün nakingküa en kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />“En dow sai maru kowh kaah mih tangka hown thawp marow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:12">now nowng chang powng chang hown kowh kaah mih tangka hown en thawp kua khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:12">Naiawng rakowi en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!<verse eid="HAB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />En nowngah mih chenchapuüa kowh kawm rak dow aiawnglowma taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">akawm akratma hown amatni changah mih maten dow maih kamta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:13">Naiawng chang mih dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Sata kowi dow tui atekma uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:14">nami iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra tuk mih maru dow lusa kowi atekma nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />“En dow kunmarau kowh kowmatia kimping namkhet kowi pe khamah arak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">en dow kimping namkhetuüa kowi tengiow tengklaima namüah kownkow arak hown pe puaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:15">Naiawng rakowi en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!<verse eid="HAB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />En kowh dow ringkawra takcha rukraira atekma nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">kawmat dow arak pua mih maru iawng tengiow tengklaima en nauowi kown mih khin chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:16">CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow en prakowi uang tarü thüm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">en kowh ringkawra dow rukraira hown natamum bowk bowt kown.<verse eid="HAB 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Lebanawn kaurawng kowi kowh singh ün en krawi kripta khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">nami iawng en kowi paw nakrip en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:17">Lebanawn kowi kowh tawncher hawmh kowi en saiah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">nami iawng en kowi paw tawncher hawmh nasai en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow krawi sai maru khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">now pren towng hai marow towng kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi en krawi chang nowng khai.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />“Arup aren dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">naiawngün dow maru thawpah mih chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:18">Huiah mih arup paw asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">naiawngün hownia dow maru ka daila reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:18">Naiawngün thawp mih maru tawngplawng kowchow aia thawpah mih uanh luk kowi tuk neplawng nesak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">naiawngün arup aren dow tuk tek lai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />En luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">En dow singh dung kowi tek pe mih, ‘Rü now lawng anging diah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">Now nowng lai dowi mih hua kowi en tek pe mih, ‘Rü now sang anging diah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:19">Tawng chow nachang kown mih arup aren nowng tek en kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:19">Naiawngün dow kuh hai tai hown kowh sowah mih chepaw naia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">tawkche naiawngün kowh dow asak uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh chimsaima mih kim kowi uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:20">aia pur kowi dow palusama maru rarimma pacham uowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Risi Habakuk chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Mami dow meng iawng risi Habakuk chup Thurai mih laiklow chekhai. <verse eid="HAB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Risi Habakuk tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh awdara uowima mih lup lawnguan ta hanow ringkawma hown ang kram en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawng mih lup anging chowng kowi paw chang iawk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">now naiawng mih lup anging chowng kowi paw tüng anging iawk diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">En kunmarau khe kowh en sana kown mih laiklow hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Nauang lawng anging kownkow Teman süng hownia Thurai uang mih ang khi khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">chimsaima mih Thurai dow uang lawng anging kownkow Paran hungh hownia uang tarü khowk chekhai. [Sela]</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">Aia kowh kri kraingra dow mukuang kowi tawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">now aia kowh rowsi kiowrira dow lusa kowi tek khai bowt.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Aia dow sat iawng tawk pluplup khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:4">aia rut hownia dow anowi uang sawt reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:4">Nami anowi kowi dow aia kowh kür uowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Aia pur kowi dow hawi rik mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:5">now aia kung hownia paw makowng hawi tawi krawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Aia iowng khe lusa mih chü reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">aia krawi tang mü khe chenchapuüa mih chür reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Achük alai kowh hungma mawngma dow aia dita nak khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">now alai chowng khe kowh hungh ün paw aia krawi chanta bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma taklowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Kusan kowi kowh maru-uüa dow nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi thüm mih ang khi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:7">now Midian kowi kowh maru-uüa paw kram kowh chürla kluk mih ang khi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, aw luk kowi en sak-ih dowi chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">En kowh kunmaraura aw luk kowi uang kla khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Sata luk kowi en sak-hiah mih nowm khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">Kawrnga kowi chowm se en krawi len mih naiawng rakowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Nadowi, lawngra kawrnga kari kowi en uang chin mih chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />En kowh leba en dowkah khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:9">now leba sek dow en tawngah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:9">Lusa dow aw iuk hai aw sowm hown en bakah khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Hungma mawngma dow khi en hanow chür reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">Tui ahuma dow hawr klunglung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">Abüpma mih tui dow atün nowk rumrum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">tuilowng dow alowngma pat talowng phunglung khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />“En kowh leba sek iow prawn rawn se tawkla plup khe kuang kowi kowh sat hai lama khowm uam chü dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:11">now pla nowi iawng en kowh reh tawk pluplup khe kuang kowi kowh sat hai lama khowm uam chü dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kunmarau hown lusa kowi en uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:12">now chenchapuüa kowi en thuaah khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />En maru-uüa kowi nauang lawngah kownkow en uang tarü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">nümnapah mih maru-uüa kowi nauang lawngah kownkow en uang lawt khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">Maru ngakuüa kowh lu dow en uang dita pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">now amatni kowh hut dow asaima en klawngta pe khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Naset anging kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa dow uang sen anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">Nakhowk khe tuak kawm tuak krat miuüa kowi kukpa krawi piak miuüa dow piawla sawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh aluchow kowi dow aia kowh reh hown en sawtah khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Ransu-uüa kowi napiakta kownkow sata kowi kawrnga hown en uang tarü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:15">now sata tui dow alowngma pat talowng phunglung khai.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />“Nami klow ang tata hanow ang chür klukluk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">ang kram lai kowh ang kowh ve hai khawk paw chür klukluk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">Nachenganchepaw anging kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi akat dow phih nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">Naiawng rakowi nami ni ang nakhila kownkow town sak se ang nachawng reng kown.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Nami khin khe uidut singh kowi uidut uihchen uowi dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">grep ruih kowi grep uih uowi dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">kanrawn singh kowi kanrawn uih uowi dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">üa hai laih kowi luprak phaw dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">ruapur tung kowi ruapur uowi dowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">chia rum kowi chia uowi dowi chepaw,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ang narowsi kiowri reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:18">ang kowh lawng miia Thurai kowi ang naawmrawm reng kown.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow ang kowh kürra chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:19">aia dow ang kowh klowng mih naki klowng iawng akrowpma chang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">Naiawng rakowi arah kroma mih kowi ün ang nowng iowng khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAB 3:19">(Mami dow meng krui mih vüi chekhai. Mami prasi lük dow ang kowh ana pek iawng aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown takla).<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>